msgstr "{user}の親は**{parent}**（{timestamp}）だ。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command option description (/familysize [user])
#: information.py:385
msgid "The user who you want to see the family size of."
msgstr "家族の人数を確認したいユーザー。"

