#: information.py:390
msgid "familysize"
msgstr "ファミリーサイズ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description (/familysize)
#: information.py:392
msgid "Get the family size of another user."
msgstr "他のユーザーの家族構成を取得する。"

#: information.py:411
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"There is **{number}** person in {user}'s family tree, including all blood "
"and non-blood relatives."
msgid_plural ""
"There are **{number}** people in {user}'s family tree, including all blood "
"and non-blood relatives."
msgstr[0] ""
"{user}の家系図には、血縁者および非血縁者を含め、**{number}**人が含まれてい"
"る。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name (/tree)
#: information.py:419
msgid "tree"
msgstr "木"

#: information.py:427 information.py:453
msgid "The user whose tree you want to see."
msgstr "表示したいツリーの所有者。"

#: information.py:431
msgid "Show your family tree, but only blood relatives :3"
msgstr "家系図を見せてくれ、ただし血縁者のみだ :3"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name (/fulltree)
#: information.py:445
msgid "fulltree"
msgstr "フルツリー"

#: information.py:457
msgid "Show your entire family tree, including non-blood relatives :3"
msgstr "血縁関係のない親戚も含めて、家系図全体を表示する :3"

#: information.py:472 subscriber_commands.py:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You need to be a higher tier subscriber to run this command! You can still "
"use {non_perks_command} though :3"
msgstr ""
"このコマンドを実行するには、上位プランの加入者である必要がある！ただし、"
"{non_perks_command}は引き続き使えるよ :3"

#: information.py:501
msgid "You have no family to put into a tree .-."
msgstr "家系図に入れる家族がいないんだ .-."

#: information.py:508
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{user} has no family to put into a tree .-."
msgstr "{user}には、ツリーに追加できる家族がいない .-."

#: information.py:578
msgid ""
"I couldn't send your family tree image - please try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "家系図の画像を送信できなかった。数分後に再度試してほしい。"

#: information.py:587
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use {fulltree} for your *entire* family, including non-blood relatives.\n"
"Use {customize} to change how your tree looks."
msgstr ""
"血縁関係のない人を含め、家族全員を登録する場合は{fulltree}を選択する。\n"
"家系図の表示方法を変更する場合は{customize}を選択する。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: marriage.py:33
